00:19:51.240 --> 00:19:53.324
I was thirsty anyway.


00:19:59.722 --> 00:20:02.763
<i>- We said no more detours.</i>
- Who is this?


00:20:02.788 --> 00:20:04.580
<i>Stop flapping your
gums and get over here.</i>


00:20:04.605 --> 00:20:06.589
- Put Veronica on.
<i>- No names.</i>


00:20:06.614 --> 00:20:08.114
<i>And don't keep her waiting.</i>


00:20:08.139 --> 00:20:09.556
No, we're not going anywhere


00:20:09.581 --> 00:20:11.459
till you tell me what's
going on, alright?


00:20:11.501 --> 00:20:14.414
Who's he been talking to?


00:20:14.439 --> 00:20:16.022
He had his cellphone with him.


00:20:16.047 --> 00:20:17.564
You know, anybody
could be tracking him.


00:20:17.589 --> 00:20:20.088
Tell me what you know,
you no-name fuck.


00:20:20.113 --> 00:20:22.947
<i>- 25,000.</i>
- What?


00:20:22.972 --> 00:20:26.708
<i>- The count was missing 25 grand.</i>
- How do you know that?


00:20:26.733 --> 00:20:28.608
<i>Shaun McCarthy,
fucking Frank's kid.</i>


00:20:28.633 --> 00:20:29.870
<i>He tipped us off
that his old man</i>


00:20:29.895 --> 00:20:32.681
<i>had exactly 900
packed up in his safe.</i>


00:20:32.706 --> 00:20:34.134
<i>It's 25 light.</i>


00:20:34.159 --> 00:20:36.338
That's it? You're gonna
kill him over 25 grand?


00:20:36.363 --> 00:20:37.736
Are you insane?


00:20:37.761 --> 00:20:40.463
How do we know for sure
it was even in there?


00:20:40.488 --> 00:20:43.590
<i>We're 25 short and someone
is gonna fucking pay.</i>


00:20:43.615 --> 00:20:45.199
Who the fuck are you?


00:20:45.224 --> 00:20:46.891
<i>Don't turn up without him.</i>


00:20:49.193 --> 00:20:50.610
Shit.


00:21:19.938 --> 00:21:21.869
- Pack of smokes.
- Sorry.


00:21:21.894 --> 00:21:23.228
The delivery didn't
come in today.


00:21:23.253 --> 00:21:25.128
What, so you're out?


00:21:25.153 --> 00:21:26.986
Yeah, that's what I just said.


00:21:27.011 --> 00:21:28.636
The fuck you mean, you're out?


00:21:28.661 --> 00:21:30.541
What, you ain't got one
pack of smokes in there?


00:21:31.040 --> 00:21:32.207
- You're lying.
- No.


00:21:47.293 --> 00:21:49.376
<i>- Hello.</i>
- Hey, it's me.


00:21:49.401 --> 00:21:52.362
<i>- Where are you calling from?</i>
- A pay phone.


00:21:52.972 --> 00:21:54.388
<i>Where's your cell?</i>


00:21:56.818 --> 00:21:58.235
<i>You're working
again, aren't you?</i>


00:21:58.260 --> 00:22:00.170
<i>Jesus, how much did
you lose this time?</i>


00:22:00.195 --> 00:22:02.112
Not now, alright,
Hayley? Just...


00:22:02.662 --> 00:22:05.037
How's he doing?


00:22:06.419 --> 00:22:09.419
<i>- He's fine.</i>
- Yeah? Can you put him on?


00:22:09.663 --> 00:22:12.121
<i>Christopher, it's your dad.</i>


00:22:13.594 --> 00:22:16.094
<i>- Dad?</i>
- Hey.


00:22:16.119 --> 00:22:18.025
How's it going? How's
Pittsburgh treating you?


00:22:18.050 --> 00:22:20.383
<i>- Fine.</i>
- Yeah?


00:22:20.408 --> 00:22:21.751
You having any fun? What
have you been up to?


00:22:21.776 --> 00:22:24.462
<i>- Um, Pete took me fishing.</i>
- Yeah?


00:22:24.487 --> 00:22:26.337
Oh, that's great.
You catch anything?


00:22:26.362 --> 00:22:27.696
<i>25-pound flathead.</i>


00:22:27.721 --> 00:22:30.516
Whoa! You got a picture?


00:22:30.541 --> 00:22:32.651
You gotta give me a picture
or it didn't happen.


00:22:32.676 --> 00:22:34.627
<i>Yeah, it's on Pete's
phone, I think.</i>


00:22:34.652 --> 00:22:37.112
- Oh, cool.
<i>- I'll send it to you.</i>


00:22:37.825 --> 00:22:39.659
It's good to hear your voice.


00:22:42.170 --> 00:22:44.754
Hey, I'm gonna come and pick
you up next week, alright?


00:22:44.779 --> 00:22:46.363
<i>I hope so.</i>


00:22:47.810 --> 00:22:49.852
Hey, I can't talk long.


00:22:49.877 --> 00:22:51.955
Will you put your
auntie back on?


00:22:52.301 --> 00:22:53.968
Enjoy the rest of
your break, alright?


00:22:53.993 --> 00:22:55.493
<i>OK, Dad.</i>


00:22:55.518 --> 00:22:58.002
Hey, I love you.


00:23:01.670 --> 00:23:03.587
<i>I'm surprised you
remembered the number.</i>


00:23:03.612 --> 00:23:05.532
Yeah, it's the same
since we were kids.


00:23:05.557 --> 00:23:08.876
<i>He's happy here. You have
a family and a life here.</i>


00:23:08.901 --> 00:23:10.956
Listen, hey, I can't
do this right now.


00:23:10.981 --> 00:23:12.540
<i>- It's always the same.</i>
- Alright, Hayley?


00:23:12.565 --> 00:23:15.291
<i>- It's been a year.</i>
- You don't think I know that?


00:23:15.316 --> 00:23:16.888
<i>He needs a fresh start
so he can move on.</i>


00:23:16.913 --> 00:23:18.704
I... I gotta go. I gotta go.


00:23:18.729 --> 00:23:20.542
<i>Just please think about...</i>


00:23:27.744 --> 00:23:30.891
- No.
- Oh, yeah, but with this shit...


00:23:30.916 --> 00:23:34.165
Oh, my God. Just
fuck off. Get out.


00:23:34.190 --> 00:23:35.317
Tasty shit.


00:23:35.342 --> 00:23:37.925
Hey, you guys done? I
got somewhere to be.


00:23:37.950 --> 00:23:39.241
Hey.


00:23:39.266 --> 00:23:40.666
Wait your turn.


00:23:48.717 --> 00:23:50.134
You're doing a
good job, alright?


00:23:50.159 --> 00:23:52.090
- Don't worry about these guys.
- Thank you.


00:23:52.115 --> 00:23:54.324
- Have a good night.
- You too.


00:24:05.268 --> 00:24:07.724
Hey! Hey!


00:24:08.852 --> 00:24:10.977
Don't worry about
them. They're assholes.


00:25:42.125 --> 00:25:45.341
Oh, what the fuck, man?


00:25:45.366 --> 00:25:47.658
Oh, you're calling McCarthy.


00:25:51.383 --> 00:25:53.979
You won't
be hard to find.


00:25:56.074 --> 00:25:59.157
And when we do find
you, just know this.


00:25:59.182 --> 00:26:02.018
- You're a fucking dead man.
- Come on.


00:26:03.842 --> 00:26:05.633
Let's go. Come on, come on.


00:26:05.658 --> 00:26:10.124
Yeah, you get used to looking
over your shoulder, asshole.


00:26:10.149 --> 00:26:12.066
Time's up! Let's fucking go!


00:26:12.091 --> 00:26:13.591
The fuck you say to me?


00:26:14.628 --> 00:26:16.337
You heard me.


00:26:16.362 --> 00:26:20.154
'Cause when we find out who
you are, I swear to God...


00:26:20.179 --> 00:26:21.179
Ugh!


00:26:21.547 --> 00:26:22.922
Dude, what the hell, man?


00:26:23.720 --> 00:26:25.131
No, I didn't hear!


00:26:25.563 --> 00:26:27.855
- Ugh!
- Say it again!


00:26:30.166 --> 00:26:32.874
Hey, man! Stop, stop!


00:26:32.899 --> 00:26:34.524
Let's go. We got we needed.


00:26:34.646 --> 00:26:36.062
Back off!


00:26:36.087 --> 00:26:37.629
Hey, now!


00:26:37.654 --> 00:26:39.445
What the fuck is
wrong with you?!


00:26:39.470 --> 00:26:41.845
- Hey, hey! Back up, back up!
- What the fuck...


00:26:41.870 --> 00:26:43.287
The fuck is wrong
with you, huh?!


00:26:43.312 --> 00:26:45.521
This is not what we
fucking talked about!


00:26:45.546 --> 00:26:48.671
- Fuck you!
- Get the fuck out of here!


00:26:48.696 --> 00:26:51.029
- Fuck you!
- Let's fucking go.


00:26:51.063 --> 00:26:52.414
Let's fucking go!
- We got what we needed.


00:26:52.516 --> 00:26:53.724
Let's go.


00:26:55.270 --> 00:26:56.895
Fuck!


00:26:58.861 --> 00:27:00.736
Goddamn it, man.


00:27:00.761 --> 00:27:02.719
I mean, what the
fuck was that, man?


00:27:03.054 --> 00:27:04.887
Bro, fucking
relax. Let's go.


00:27:09.343 --> 00:27:12.718
Fuck! Go, go, go!


00:27:12.743 --> 00:27:15.535
We'll fucking find you!


00:27:15.560 --> 00:27:16.977
Assholes!


00:27:46.659 --> 00:27:50.034
Shit. Same guys from
the gas station.


00:27:51.770 --> 00:27:54.274
Looks like a different vehicle.


00:27:59.097 --> 00:28:01.347
Just stay down. Cover your ears.


00:28:03.962 --> 00:28:05.712
Whoa. Hey.


00:28:38.544 --> 00:28:40.752
Are we good? Are we
being followed or what?


00:28:40.777 --> 00:28:42.860
I thought so, but I
think we're clear.


00:28:45.628 --> 00:28:47.711
I mean, well, you could
put your gun back.


00:28:59.143 --> 00:29:01.351
Hey, just so you know...


00:29:02.434 --> 00:29:04.309
he's no friend of mine.


00:29:06.422 --> 00:29:08.094
Who are you talking about?


00:29:08.119 --> 00:29:10.328
That piece of shit
you were working with,


00:29:10.353 --> 00:29:11.936
you called him my friend.


00:29:13.132 --> 00:29:14.841
You worked with him before?


00:29:14.866 --> 00:29:16.063
Yeah.


00:29:16.911 --> 00:29:18.536
Never again.


00:29:20.539 --> 00:29:23.831
I've never seen somebody get
fucked up like that before, man.


00:29:25.310 --> 00:29:27.768
Not like that, not up close.


00:29:29.124 --> 00:29:32.874
I mean, I keep playing that
shit over and over in my head,


00:29:33.587 --> 00:29:36.462
just boots just
hitting his skull.


00:29:38.368 --> 00:29:39.428
I mean, I should've stepped in.


00:29:39.453 --> 00:29:40.745
I should've stopped
him or something.


00:29:40.770 --> 00:29:41.979
You couldn't have stopped him.


00:29:42.004 --> 00:29:44.088
He's a fucking animal,
just like you said.


00:29:44.513 --> 00:29:47.388
That shit is on him.
He lost his cool.


00:29:47.413 --> 00:29:50.746
You did your part.
Just let it go.


00:29:53.502 --> 00:29:55.078
I'm not saying
McCarthy deserved it,


00:29:55.103 --> 00:29:57.186
but he laundered a
shit-ton of money


00:29:57.211 --> 00:30:01.344
for a ton of shitty
people, so... fuck him too.


00:30:03.427 --> 00:30:04.636
Yeah.


00:30:06.193 --> 00:30:07.907
Fuck him.


00:30:09.999 --> 00:30:14.525
Hey, listen, what happened
back at that gas station...


00:30:14.550 --> 00:30:16.210
I don't... I don't make a
habit of doing that shit.


00:30:16.235 --> 00:30:19.053
I... I just drive.


00:30:19.930 --> 00:30:21.778
They just caught
me on a bad day.


00:30:21.803 --> 00:30:23.887
Huh, I should say.


00:30:34.529 --> 00:30:37.362
What'd you do? What the
fuck happened back there?!


00:30:39.120 --> 00:30:41.578
Fuck!


00:30:41.603 --> 00:30:44.395
Fucking kid freaked out
is what happened, man!


00:30:44.420 --> 00:30:46.795
That piece of shit got
what he fucking deserved.


00:30:46.820 --> 00:30:47.959
Shut the fuck up!


00:30:50.009 --> 00:30:52.467
Yeah, well, I think you
fucking killed him, man!


00:30:52.492 --> 00:30:54.783
- Jesus!
- Fuck you! Shut the fuck up!


00:30:54.808 --> 00:30:57.549
That asshole owes my brother
a lot of fucking money!


00:31:01.158 --> 00:31:03.637
Well, you did too and you
fucking got shot, you idiot!


00:31:03.678 --> 00:31:05.970
We fucking got the
job done, didn't we?


00:31:05.995 --> 00:31:07.245
Shut the fuck up!


00:31:43.718 --> 00:31:45.607
Shit.


00:31:47.480 --> 00:31:49.230
What do they want, man?


00:31:49.255 --> 00:31:51.333
Jesus, we weren't speeding.


00:32:03.753 --> 00:32:06.044
This thing's not stolen, is it?


00:32:06.069 --> 00:32:08.194
No, it isn't stolen.


00:32:09.251 --> 00:32:10.626
Don't say anything stupid.


00:32:10.651 --> 00:32:12.435
I don't want them
to search the car.


00:32:17.281 --> 00:32:19.281
- Evening, fellas. Licence.
- Officer.


00:32:26.152 --> 00:32:27.985
- Nice car.
- Thank you.


00:32:28.010 --> 00:32:29.992
I'm looking for a
car just like this.


00:32:30.017 --> 00:32:32.684
Yeah, they're getting rarer
to come by these days.


00:32:32.709 --> 00:32:35.041
Yeah, they are. Not
many in this area.


00:32:35.066 --> 00:32:36.982
- No.
- You from out of town?


00:32:37.007 --> 00:32:39.215
Uh, yeah, just
outside of Ashland.


00:32:39.240 --> 00:32:41.907
In fact, I picked this up at
a classic dealer up that way.


00:32:41.932 --> 00:32:43.349
I didn't say I was
looking to buy.


00:32:43.374 --> 00:32:45.332
I said I'm looking
for a car like this,


00:32:45.357 --> 00:32:47.190
a black 1970 Chevelle,


00:32:47.215 --> 00:32:50.256
last seen at a gas
station a few miles back.


00:32:50.281 --> 00:32:52.340
Oh, we haven't been to any
gas stations this evening.


00:32:52.365 --> 00:32:53.574
- Mn-mn.
- Is that right?


00:32:53.599 --> 00:32:54.742
- No, sir.
- The clerk called it in.


00:32:54.767 --> 00:32:56.319
Said there was an altercation.


00:32:56.344 --> 00:32:58.344
Well, I hope everybody's OK.


00:33:04.449 --> 00:33:07.240
We like to keep the
peace around these parts.


00:33:07.265 --> 00:33:08.682
Yes, sir.


00:33:16.459 --> 00:33:18.191
That blood on your jacket?


00:33:18.216 --> 00:33:20.899
Uh... Oh, yeah.


00:33:20.945 --> 00:33:23.403
He just gets nose bleeds
every now and then.


00:33:23.428 --> 00:33:24.803
Hey, am I talking to you?


00:33:26.259 --> 00:33:29.009
Wait, wait. Ain't
you Keith's kid?


00:33:29.034 --> 00:33:31.143
Shit, that is you.
It's Jacob, right?


00:33:31.168 --> 00:33:33.668
Jake, yeah. What's up, Carl?


00:33:33.709 --> 00:33:35.334
Last time I saw you,


00:33:35.376 --> 00:33:38.302
you must have been 11
or 12 at the Crescent.


00:33:38.327 --> 00:33:40.077
Your old man loved that bar.


00:33:40.102 --> 00:33:41.828
- Always brought you in.
- Yeah.


00:33:41.853 --> 00:33:43.787
You know it's a parking
lot now, would you believe?


00:33:52.793 --> 00:33:54.654
Goddamn rubbernecks.


00:33:54.679 --> 00:33:57.763
How your old man doing?
Haven't seen him in years.


00:33:57.788 --> 00:33:59.705
Oh, man, he's doing great.


00:33:59.730 --> 00:34:01.521
Yeah, still bowling
every Friday night.


00:34:01.547 --> 00:34:03.755
I bet. I tell you what.


00:34:03.780 --> 00:34:06.613
Get him to give me a
call. It's been too long.


00:34:07.810 --> 00:34:10.019
Yeah, he'd like that.


00:34:11.808 --> 00:34:13.224
Shit.


00:34:23.519 --> 00:34:25.479
Alright, fellas, I'm gonna
let you be on your way.


00:34:26.566 --> 00:34:28.941
Tell Keith I look
forward to catching up.


00:34:29.427 --> 00:34:31.668
Thank you. Have a good night.


00:34:31.709 --> 00:34:33.418
Get that nose bleed looked at.


00:34:33.443 --> 00:34:34.860
Yes, sir.


00:34:44.204 --> 00:34:45.942
Your old man's a cop, huh?


00:34:46.550 --> 00:34:48.341
No, far from it.


00:34:48.366 --> 00:34:50.991
He's just an old drinking buddy.


00:34:51.027 --> 00:34:52.777
Fucking small town.


00:35:14.918 --> 00:35:17.646
Dad used to take me
and my brother here.


00:35:18.078 --> 00:35:20.578
Used to have this roller-coaster
called the Crusher.


00:35:20.723 --> 00:35:22.556
So fun, man.


00:35:22.581 --> 00:35:25.331
We'd wait hours just to
get 30 seconds on it.


00:35:25.459 --> 00:35:27.043
So worth it.


00:35:28.446 --> 00:35:30.515
He'd leave us there all day.


00:35:30.540 --> 00:35:33.123
There was a dog track
about a mile from here.


00:35:34.076 --> 00:35:36.618
Never knew what mood
he was gonna be in


00:35:36.643 --> 00:35:37.976
when he picked us up.


00:35:39.376 --> 00:35:41.376
Is he still around?


00:35:41.418 --> 00:35:44.501
Fuck if I know. It's been
years since I've seen him.


00:35:44.543 --> 00:35:45.677
Hm.


00:35:45.702 --> 00:35:47.244
Probably drank himself to death.


00:35:48.782 --> 00:35:50.382
I don't even remember
what he looks like.


00:35:53.376 --> 00:35:57.043
The way I figured it is I
can end up just like him,


00:35:57.084 --> 00:35:59.990
you know, the way
everyone expects,


00:36:00.082 --> 00:36:02.290
or I could say,
"Fuck that shit,"


00:36:02.418 --> 00:36:05.418
do my own thing, do it better,


00:36:05.614 --> 00:36:07.073
simple as that.


00:36:08.543 --> 00:36:10.615
No, I know. Look
who's talking, right?


00:36:11.328 --> 00:36:13.786
But all this, everything
I'm up to right now is...


00:36:14.881 --> 00:36:17.006
so Hayley has a
better shot, you know?


00:36:19.099 --> 00:36:21.349
'Cause she ain't never gonna
forget what I look like.


00:36:23.501 --> 00:36:25.168
That's for fucking sure.


00:36:35.251 --> 00:36:37.209
That your wife?


00:36:37.251 --> 00:36:38.751
Yeah.


00:36:40.084 --> 00:36:42.043
She's not happy when
I'm running late.


00:36:43.209 --> 00:36:45.293
Fuck, I know that feeling.


00:36:47.834 --> 00:36:50.501
You know it's not fair, right?


00:36:50.543 --> 00:36:55.293
You know my name now
and I don't know yours.


00:36:55.334 --> 00:36:58.251
Would it kill you just
to call yourself John


00:36:58.293 --> 00:37:02.091
or Ryan or anything?


00:37:02.116 --> 00:37:06.449
Yeah, it's John Ryan.
Good guess, actually.


00:37:15.293 --> 00:37:17.001
Didn't these guys
pass us before?


00:37:17.043 --> 00:37:19.193
Yeah, I think so.


00:37:53.709 --> 00:37:54.950
Fuck.


00:37:55.168 --> 00:37:57.543
Shit. He's coming up on us.


00:37:57.584 --> 00:37:59.763
Holy shit, he's got a gun!


00:38:00.084 --> 00:38:01.668
- Pull over!
- Fuck!


00:38:04.043 --> 00:38:05.474
Get up.


00:38:20.084 --> 00:38:21.709
Why are they trying to kill us?


00:38:40.881 --> 00:38:42.756
Shit! I'm empty.


00:38:42.781 --> 00:38:44.781
Check... check the glove box.


00:38:44.806 --> 00:38:46.722
I got you, I got you.


00:38:46.747 --> 00:38:49.705
No, no, no! Shit!
It's empty too, man.


00:38:51.839 --> 00:38:53.797
There's nothing else. Shit!


00:38:54.865 --> 00:38:56.365
We're good in here, right?


00:39:00.618 --> 00:39:02.076
Where are those guys?


00:39:10.376 --> 00:39:11.857
Come on.


00:39:12.418 --> 00:39:14.005
Let's go.


00:39:17.891 --> 00:39:19.349
There's no route this way!


00:39:23.840 --> 00:39:25.904
Shit!


00:39:26.209 --> 00:39:28.084
What? What? What?
Keep it going, man!


00:39:28.126 --> 00:39:30.459
Shit.


00:39:30.501 --> 00:39:32.084
Fuck.


00:39:35.167 --> 00:39:37.375
This can't be the
plan, man, right?


00:39:37.400 --> 00:39:39.400
I mean, can't we, like,
run them over or something?


00:39:40.709 --> 00:39:42.834
- Put your hands out the window.
- What?


00:39:42.876 --> 00:39:45.334
Just put your hands
out the fucking window!


00:39:48.126 --> 00:39:50.043
Put your hands where
I can see them.


00:39:51.376 --> 00:39:54.001
And move slowly towards me.


00:39:54.043 --> 00:39:57.709
I can't die, man. I
can't fucking die.


00:39:57.751 --> 00:39:59.450
I c...


00:39:59.475 --> 00:40:01.559
Just be cool and get out.


00:40:10.001 --> 00:40:12.168
Come on, slowly.


00:40:16.267 --> 00:40:17.433
Good.


00:40:17.458 --> 00:40:21.001
You, roll down your sleeves.


00:40:21.685 --> 00:40:22.876
What?


00:40:22.918 --> 00:40:25.918
I said pull down
your fucking sleeves!


00:40:32.293 --> 00:40:33.709
We got you.


00:40:37.204 --> 00:40:39.371
We fucking got you.


00:40:43.626 --> 00:40:44.751
Shit.


00:40:45.183 --> 00:40:46.411
We got him!


00:41:03.668 --> 00:41:04.876
You're not so fucking tough


00:41:04.918 --> 00:41:06.247
without your fucking
shotgun, are you?


00:41:06.272 --> 00:41:08.622
Fuck, here we go.


00:41:09.287 --> 00:41:10.996
Yeah.


00:41:12.876 --> 00:41:14.209
Is that him?


00:41:20.066 --> 00:41:21.774
Say something.


00:41:24.863 --> 00:41:26.488
What do you want me to say?


00:41:27.668 --> 00:41:29.168
Tell me you're gonna...


00:41:30.355 --> 00:41:32.480
blow my fucking head off.


00:41:33.388 --> 00:41:34.621
Say it.


00:41:35.958 --> 00:41:38.750
I'm gonna blow your
fucking head off.


00:41:41.732 --> 00:41:44.107
It's not him, man. It's not him.


00:41:44.959 --> 00:41:46.886
He's just the driver, man.


00:41:46.911 --> 00:41:49.661
I was there, I can tell
you that's not him.


00:41:50.543 --> 00:41:53.168
I don't know the guy's name,
who you're looking for,


00:41:53.193 --> 00:41:55.918
but I can tell
you we had no idea


00:41:55.959 --> 00:41:58.293
he was gonna pull that
fucking shit out, OK?


00:42:02.001 --> 00:42:05.752
What about you?
You know his name?


00:42:05.777 --> 00:42:07.185
No.


00:42:09.293 --> 00:42:11.168
What about my money?


00:42:11.209 --> 00:42:13.251
You know what
happened to my money?


00:42:13.293 --> 00:42:16.168
No, they don't tell me
that shit. I'm the driver.


00:42:16.209 --> 00:42:17.543
Hmm.


00:42:25.126 --> 00:42:27.251
You don't have
a lot to say, do you?


00:42:28.290 --> 00:42:30.623
What if I gouge your
fucking eyes out?


00:42:30.648 --> 00:42:31.981
Will you talk then?


00:42:35.764 --> 00:42:37.847
Oh, look at that.
Maybe you got a wife.


00:42:37.872 --> 00:42:40.161
Maybe I should pay
her a call, huh?


00:42:40.669 --> 00:42:41.808
You fucking...


00:42:41.833 --> 00:42:44.918
You, get down on your
fucking hands and knees.


00:42:44.959 --> 00:42:46.227
Get down on
your fucking knees.


00:42:46.251 --> 00:42:47.584
The fuck you looking here for?


00:42:47.626 --> 00:42:49.043
Get on your fucking knees!


00:42:49.084 --> 00:42:51.209
Can... can we please
talk about this?


00:42:51.251 --> 00:42:53.168
Hmm, OK.


00:42:54.168 --> 00:42:56.668
I had a little...


00:42:56.709 --> 00:43:00.084
I had a little head
injury recently


00:43:00.126 --> 00:43:03.418
so I wanna be quite
sure I got this clear.


00:43:04.668 --> 00:43:06.126
You don't have my money,


00:43:06.168 --> 00:43:08.126
don't know the name of the guy


00:43:08.168 --> 00:43:10.668
that turned my head
into a fucking piñata.


00:43:10.709 --> 00:43:14.261
We can figure that out.
We can find the guy.


00:43:14.286 --> 00:43:17.019
We can find his name, give
you the money, all that.


00:43:17.044 --> 00:43:19.918
- But if you kill us...
- If I kill you?


00:43:19.959 --> 00:43:21.501
If I kill you?


00:43:23.001 --> 00:43:25.590
I thought I made it clear


00:43:25.615 --> 00:43:29.793
that nobody steals from
me and gets to live.


00:43:29.834 --> 00:43:32.308
Nobody? What about him?


00:43:32.880 --> 00:43:34.404
The fuck you talking about?


00:43:34.429 --> 00:43:38.363
Is he the exception,
this piece of shit, huh?


00:43:38.388 --> 00:43:40.126
Why don't you ask your boy


00:43:40.151 --> 00:43:41.669
how they knew what was
in the safe, Frank.


00:43:41.694 --> 00:43:43.486
- Shut the fuck up!
- Huh? Go ahead, Frank.


00:43:43.668 --> 00:43:45.675
Ask him about his deal.


00:43:45.700 --> 00:43:47.310
- Dad, he's a fucking liar.
- Why don't you tell him, Shaun?


00:43:47.334 --> 00:43:49.376
How much of the cut
had your name on it?


00:43:49.418 --> 00:43:50.769
- Don't listen to this shit!
- I'm guessing half.


00:43:50.793 --> 00:43:52.144
- Think it was half?
- Shut the fuck up!


00:43:52.168 --> 00:43:54.084
- I'm thinking half.
- Shut the fuck up.


00:43:55.084 --> 00:43:58.209
You fucked me over?


00:43:58.251 --> 00:44:01.084
No. No, no, no.
It's not like that.


00:44:01.126 --> 00:44:03.126
- It's not.
- Don't you lie to me.


00:44:03.168 --> 00:44:05.584
- I'm not.
- Don't you fucking lie to me.


00:44:06.834 --> 00:44:08.543
You fucking weasel.


00:44:09.114 --> 00:44:10.781
My own son.


00:44:11.755 --> 00:44:13.862
You piece of shit.


00:44:20.543 --> 00:44:23.793
You should have... you
should have killed me.


00:44:23.834 --> 00:44:26.709
You should have
fucking killed me!


00:44:26.751 --> 00:44:29.251
I didn't want to fucking
kill you, alright?


00:44:29.293 --> 00:44:31.668
That was the fucking
deal! You fucked it up!


00:44:31.709 --> 00:44:33.126
Why'd you say you
wanted him dead?


00:44:33.168 --> 00:44:34.269
- I didn't fucking say that.
- Bullshit!


00:44:34.293 --> 00:44:35.709
You said you wanted him dead.


00:44:35.751 --> 00:44:37.543
You shut the fuck
up. Shut the fuck up!


00:44:37.584 --> 00:44:39.876
- "Kill him and take it all."
- Stop fucking lying!


00:44:39.918 --> 00:44:43.126
Hey, I heard, "Kill
him, take it all.".


00:44:43.364 --> 00:44:44.947
That's what I heard, Frank.


00:44:44.972 --> 00:44:46.638
- He said...
- Fuck!


00:44:47.910 --> 00:44:49.676
- Alright.
- Hey!


00:44:49.950 --> 00:44:51.209
Fuck!


00:44:52.584 --> 00:44:55.543
Now, we kill these fucks


00:44:56.185 --> 00:44:58.918
and then we talk.


00:45:05.180 --> 00:45:06.805
Dad, hold him!


00:45:12.394 --> 00:45:13.685
Ugh!


00:45:44.216 --> 00:45:45.450
Ugh!


00:46:24.550 --> 00:46:26.175
You did good.


00:47:31.867 --> 00:47:33.075
Oh...


00:48:27.417 --> 00:48:29.875
- You OK?
- Mm-hm.


00:48:29.996 --> 00:48:31.746
Hey, what's going
on? What's going on?


00:48:33.220 --> 00:48:34.386
Hey, hey.


00:48:34.411 --> 00:48:35.957
What's going on? You alright?


00:48:35.982 --> 00:48:38.668
I can't...


00:48:38.709 --> 00:48:41.126
- Huh? What?
- I can't... I can't breathe.


00:48:41.168 --> 00:48:42.918
Just sit back, sit
back, sit back.


00:48:43.724 --> 00:48:44.730
- I need my inhaler.
- Hey, hey, hey.


00:48:44.755 --> 00:48:45.876
Listen to me, listen to me.


00:48:45.918 --> 00:48:47.449
- I need my inhaler.
- Just breathe, breathe.


00:48:47.474 --> 00:48:49.293
- I can't...
- Just take a breath.


00:48:49.334 --> 00:48:51.459
Take a breath, take a breath.


00:48:51.501 --> 00:48:54.001
- Hey, hey, just... just relax.
- I need my inhaler.


00:48:54.043 --> 00:48:55.543
I can't...


00:48:55.584 --> 00:48:57.668
Where the fuck is it?


00:48:58.747 --> 00:48:59.754
I need it.


00:48:59.779 --> 00:49:01.777
Hey, calm down, calm down.


00:49:01.802 --> 00:49:04.496
Just breathe, breathe,
alright? Just relax.


00:49:04.521 --> 00:49:06.340
Alright, just... Hey, hey.


00:49:06.365 --> 00:49:07.927
Think about your
daughter, alright?


00:49:07.972 --> 00:49:09.472
It's Hayley, yeah?


00:49:12.021 --> 00:49:14.205
I remember you saying that
because that's my sister's name.


00:49:14.230 --> 00:49:15.980
Hayley, it's a pretty name.


00:49:16.085 --> 00:49:18.953
Just relax, OK?


00:49:18.978 --> 00:49:20.561
Just breathe.


00:49:25.177 --> 00:49:26.593
Just breathe.


00:49:31.271 --> 00:49:34.104
Calm down.


00:49:38.274 --> 00:49:39.899
You OK?


00:49:44.755 --> 00:49:47.755
Man... I can't have
you dying in here.


00:49:47.780 --> 00:49:50.005
This is my father's car.


00:49:50.114 --> 00:49:51.905
This was his pride and joy.


00:49:53.333 --> 00:49:55.042
You OK?


00:50:02.639 --> 00:50:03.806
Can you tell me about him?


00:50:04.774 --> 00:50:06.399
Yeah, he was nice.


00:50:07.184 --> 00:50:10.059
Kinda too nice, you know?


00:50:10.624 --> 00:50:12.499
That was his weakness.


00:50:12.524 --> 00:50:14.482
He always saw the
best in everyone.


00:50:16.344 --> 00:50:18.341
That doesn't
sound like a weakness.


00:50:19.789 --> 00:50:22.664
Well, people are assholes.
You know, they take advantage.


00:50:24.080 --> 00:50:26.786
He'd go out of his
way to help everyone,


00:50:27.063 --> 00:50:28.896
spread himself too thin.


00:50:30.581 --> 00:50:32.331
It nearly cost him his marriage.


00:50:36.404 --> 00:50:39.124
I remember when I went
away for a few years,


00:50:39.149 --> 00:50:41.441
I asked him not
to, but he would...


00:50:41.466 --> 00:50:45.234
he would drive five hours
round trip every weekend


00:50:45.259 --> 00:50:48.842
for a 20-minute
visitation, every weekend.


00:50:52.630 --> 00:50:56.088
And he had every reason to look
at me like a piece of shit,


00:50:56.113 --> 00:50:57.654
but he never did.


00:50:59.618 --> 00:51:01.618
He just kept me going.


00:51:03.609 --> 00:51:05.484
Yeah, well...


00:51:05.509 --> 00:51:07.676
The rest of my family
wasn't so kind.


00:51:08.978 --> 00:51:11.436
Anyway, this is all
I got left of him.


00:51:14.567 --> 00:51:17.192
So don't slam the doors.


00:51:22.731 --> 00:51:24.190
You alright?


00:51:25.988 --> 00:51:27.196
Yeah.


00:51:29.259 --> 00:51:30.634
I'm alright.


00:51:31.571 --> 00:51:33.571
They were gonna kill us.
You know that, right?


00:51:34.915 --> 00:51:36.457
There's nothing we
could have said.


00:51:39.999 --> 00:51:41.957
You did the right thing.


00:51:41.982 --> 00:51:44.059
If you didn't do what you did,


00:51:44.716 --> 00:51:47.467
we'd both be laying down out
there face down right now


00:51:47.492 --> 00:51:49.534
instead of them.


00:51:51.272 --> 00:51:52.689
OK?


00:51:57.284 --> 00:51:58.617
I gotta make a phone call,


00:51:58.642 --> 00:52:00.350
let them know we're
gonna be late.


00:52:00.375 --> 00:52:02.855
Just relax, keep breathing.


00:52:19.174 --> 00:52:21.132
<i>Alright, smart-ass,
where the fuck are you?</i>


00:52:21.157 --> 00:52:24.074
You put her on. No more
fucking around. Put her on!


00:52:24.099 --> 00:52:26.599
<i>Oh, this better be good.</i>


00:52:26.624 --> 00:52:28.909
<i>- Yeah, he's on.</i>
<i>- You're late.</i>


00:52:28.934 --> 00:52:31.018
Did you know Frank
was still alive?


00:52:31.762 --> 00:52:34.178
<i>- What?</i>
- Well, he was.


00:52:34.834 --> 00:52:36.896
I don't know how
they tracked us down,


00:52:36.921 --> 00:52:39.458
but this shit didn't end well.


00:52:40.546 --> 00:52:42.410
<i>This mess keeps getting worse.</i>


00:52:42.435 --> 00:52:44.332
None of this shit
would have happened


00:52:44.357 --> 00:52:47.816
if Leon hadn't acted
like a goddamn maniac.


00:52:48.203 --> 00:52:50.738
And now Shaun is dead,
he doesn't need his cut.


00:52:50.763 --> 00:52:54.847
So who gives a shit
about a missing 25 grand?


00:52:55.320 --> 00:52:56.699
Why can't we just call this?


00:52:56.724 --> 00:52:58.636
<i>Are you telling me
how to run things?</i>


00:52:58.661 --> 00:53:00.332
<i>Is that what you do now?</i>


00:53:00.357 --> 00:53:03.655
<i>Do me a favour. Don't forget
who you're talking to.</i>


00:53:03.680 --> 00:53:06.091
Listen, I understand.
It's just that...


00:53:07.052 --> 00:53:10.677
This kid, he handled
himself well.


00:53:11.657 --> 00:53:13.699
He had my back. He was great.


00:53:15.245 --> 00:53:16.870
Can't we just call this?


00:53:17.575 --> 00:53:20.434
<i>Bring him to me. I
just wanna talk to him.</i>


00:53:21.387 --> 00:53:22.821
<i>Turn up without him</i>


00:53:22.846 --> 00:53:25.044
<i>and you're gonna wish
that Frank had killed you.</i>


00:54:08.951 --> 00:54:10.534
I found your thing.


00:54:12.026 --> 00:54:13.318
Thanks.


00:54:13.592 --> 00:54:15.342
Where'd you get that?


00:54:16.359 --> 00:54:19.568
- You going through my shit?
- No, it fell out.


00:54:24.318 --> 00:54:25.568
This your son?


00:54:26.526 --> 00:54:28.151
Yeah.


00:54:29.651 --> 00:54:33.651
What's he, like... seven, eight?


00:54:36.484 --> 00:54:38.484
No, he's about 15 now.


00:54:40.169 --> 00:54:42.252
- 15?
- Mm-hm.


00:54:46.401 --> 00:54:47.693
Hey.


00:54:49.693 --> 00:54:52.318
Hmm.


00:54:52.359 --> 00:54:53.818
Wow.


00:54:55.984 --> 00:54:58.859
Hey, uh, I just...


00:55:01.542 --> 00:55:02.834
wanna say thanks for...


00:55:06.901 --> 00:55:08.484
helping me breathe there.


00:55:10.484 --> 00:55:12.818
- Yep.
- Thanks.


00:55:54.146 --> 00:55:56.243
Yeah, we just landed.
They're headed your way.


00:55:56.268 --> 00:55:58.323
He's gonna need stitching up.


00:55:58.348 --> 00:56:00.223
I'll deal with the car.


00:56:04.568 --> 00:56:06.401
Jesus fucking Christ!


00:56:07.651 --> 00:56:10.109
What are we gonna do
about that shit, huh?!


00:56:10.416 --> 00:56:12.416
Keep your voice
down. Help him out.


00:56:17.984 --> 00:56:19.609
Don't you
fucking touch me.


00:56:19.651 --> 00:56:21.068
Let's go.


00:56:23.206 --> 00:56:25.289
You got two minutes
to get to the pickup.


00:56:25.314 --> 00:56:26.897
I got it, I got it.


00:57:10.710 --> 00:57:12.544
Do you still take
your kid fishing?


00:57:14.263 --> 00:57:16.388
Yeah, from time to time.


00:57:18.359 --> 00:57:22.732
Yeah, I mean, I used
to go up... Mill Creek.


00:57:22.757 --> 00:57:24.550
There's some good
carp over there.


00:57:26.826 --> 00:57:29.951
My dad was the only one that
caught the fish, though.


00:57:31.052 --> 00:57:32.552
I'd hold the camera.


00:57:35.818 --> 00:57:37.776
We'd go out, like,
every Sunday morning.


00:57:39.232 --> 00:57:41.732
He'd show up at the door


00:57:41.757 --> 00:57:43.799
in this shitty car...


00:57:45.875 --> 00:57:47.750
honking a mile away.


00:57:52.428 --> 00:57:53.970
He was always late.


00:57:55.861 --> 00:57:57.236
Huh.


00:57:58.572 --> 00:58:00.405
One day I was sitting
in the driveway


00:58:00.430 --> 00:58:02.081
a little longer than usual.


00:58:04.187 --> 00:58:06.104
An hour goes by.


00:58:07.799 --> 00:58:09.341
Another hour.


00:58:11.455 --> 00:58:13.955
And I just knew he
wasn't gonna show up.


00:58:18.065 --> 00:58:19.648
And he didn't...


00:58:21.857 --> 00:58:23.607
12 years ago.


00:58:30.284 --> 00:58:31.808
Who fucking just disappears


00:58:31.833 --> 00:58:34.833
on their kid like
that, you know?


00:58:38.043 --> 00:58:40.802
I'm
gonna take Hayley,


00:58:40.827 --> 00:58:42.660
go make some new memories,


00:58:42.685 --> 00:58:44.601
pave right over the old ones.


00:58:47.187 --> 00:58:49.271
<i>Ad Meliora.</i>


00:58:51.803 --> 00:58:55.011
Latin or some shit. It
means 'new beginnings'.


00:58:55.036 --> 00:58:57.995
My mom had it tatted on her arm.


00:59:01.381 --> 00:59:03.172
She probably didn't
even know what it meant.


00:59:06.651 --> 00:59:09.443
I liked it. It gave
me hope, you know?


00:59:09.484 --> 00:59:11.425
Made me think of a new future.


00:59:13.390 --> 00:59:16.140
Yeah, I think it's,
<i>"Semper ad meliora."</i>


00:59:17.248 --> 00:59:18.914
"Towards better things."


00:59:20.038 --> 00:59:21.413
It's nice.


00:59:25.052 --> 00:59:27.052
"Towards better things."


00:59:31.442 --> 00:59:33.753
What else is your kid into?


00:59:34.620 --> 00:59:36.138
He's a teenager.


00:59:36.163 --> 00:59:37.705
He likes to drive fast.


00:59:38.760 --> 00:59:40.593
I take him out in
this sometimes.


00:59:42.702 --> 00:59:44.244
This will be his one day.


00:59:45.049 --> 00:59:48.341
Ah, lucky him.


00:59:49.255 --> 00:59:50.880
It's a nice car to learn in.


00:59:52.808 --> 00:59:54.767
Be careful, though.


00:59:54.792 --> 00:59:58.501
He's gonna be stealing your keys
and taking those girls out soon.


01:00:00.865 --> 01:00:02.573
Is he already doing that?


01:00:08.055 --> 01:00:09.847
Oh, man, I am not
looking forward


01:00:09.872 --> 01:00:11.456
to Hayley being that age.


01:00:13.523 --> 01:00:16.607
Stuff I was doing at 15? Mn-mn.


01:00:19.173 --> 01:00:20.965
I'm gonna be scaring
off every asshole


01:00:20.990 --> 01:00:22.698
that comes knocking, man.


01:00:25.686 --> 01:00:28.728
Patting my hand with a
baseball bat, redneck style.


01:00:31.273 --> 01:00:33.440
Ain't nobody's good
enough for her.


01:00:39.427 --> 01:00:41.510
Not in this town anyway.


01:00:57.631 --> 01:00:59.482
I just hope she never finds
out I killed somebody.


01:00:59.507 --> 01:01:01.257
At least that's for sure.


01:01:09.571 --> 01:01:11.779
So much for Batman.


01:01:35.635 --> 01:01:37.135
Where would you go?


01:01:40.271 --> 01:01:41.812
What?


01:01:43.019 --> 01:01:44.409
Where would you go?


01:01:44.434 --> 01:01:45.954
You said you wanted
to get out of here.


01:01:48.025 --> 01:01:50.317
Start a better life with
you and your daughter.


01:01:51.091 --> 01:01:53.065
Where would you go?


01:01:57.921 --> 01:02:00.587
I don't think I'm
supposed to tell you that.


01:02:00.612 --> 01:02:02.109
See, I'm catching on.


01:02:02.151 --> 01:02:04.901
Just forget all
that shit, alright?


01:02:05.351 --> 01:02:07.309
Have you got someplace
where you got family?


01:02:07.334 --> 01:02:09.000
Someplace you can go?


01:02:10.155 --> 01:02:13.362
Anywhere you... you
could go if you had to?


01:02:15.987 --> 01:02:18.866
Man, you've gotta be thinking
about your next move, alright?


01:02:19.484 --> 01:02:20.822
What are you talking about?


01:02:22.647 --> 01:02:24.105
Hey, we've gotta go, man.


01:02:24.130 --> 01:02:25.650
You've got a green.


01:02:36.594 --> 01:02:38.058
You OK?


01:02:44.893 --> 01:02:47.560
Yo!


01:02:50.779 --> 01:02:52.237
You lost?


01:02:53.229 --> 01:02:55.604
Oh, this joker.


01:02:55.825 --> 01:02:57.825
After you.


01:03:00.653 --> 01:03:02.528
