a quick recovery.


01:03:02.553 --> 01:03:04.137
Fucking ass.


01:03:36.607 --> 01:03:37.940
Fuck it.


01:04:10.934 --> 01:04:12.350
Nice place.


01:04:55.049 --> 01:04:56.466
