01:05:43.700 --> 01:05:45.533
Got a boo-boo there, princess?


01:05:46.819 --> 01:05:48.198
OK.


01:05:48.223 --> 01:05:50.348
You, come on. Spread them, kid.


01:05:55.148 --> 01:05:56.564
Alright.


01:05:56.589 --> 01:05:58.427
What the fuck is this?


01:05:58.452 --> 01:06:01.119
- It's my inhaler.
- He needs it.


01:06:02.557 --> 01:06:03.932
Right.


01:06:09.299 --> 01:06:10.924
Come on.


01:06:17.069 --> 01:06:18.569
