01:06:34.085 --> 01:06:36.125
- Cheers, boss.
- Don't fuck up the next one.


01:06:36.651 --> 01:06:38.520
Oi, back to work, motherfucker!


01:06:38.545 --> 01:06:39.961
Yeah, yeah, I'm doing it.


01:06:39.986 --> 01:06:42.722
