And what part of that
is my fucking problem?


01:06:47.422 --> 01:06:49.131
If you did your job
in the first place,


01:06:49.156 --> 01:06:50.507
he wouldn't be
sitting in a jail cell


01:06:50.547 --> 01:06:52.131
