who come recommended.


01:07:20.417 --> 01:07:23.698
Must be nice to finally
make some real money.


01:07:24.097 --> 01:07:26.609
Yeah, very thankful for
the, uh, opportunities.


01:07:26.651 --> 01:07:28.609
Yeah, well, you
held yourself well.


01:07:28.651 --> 01:07:33.177
You keep doing what you're
doing and you'll go places.


01:07:33.810 --> 01:07:34.997
