01:07:36.169 --> 01:07:39.169
You had an eventful
journey, I hear.


01:07:39.818 --> 01:07:42.060
Oh, it was eventful.


01:07:43.196 --> 01:07:44.988
Any idea how they found us?


01:07:45.013 --> 01:07:47.971
No, this town has some
big mouths. You know that.


01:07:49.656 --> 01:07:51.615
So you killed Shaun?


01:07:53.776 --> 01:07:57.027
- Yeah, he did good.
- Yeah.


01:07:57.052 --> 01:08:00.544
Yeah, well, better
off without him.


01:08:00.569 --> 01:08:02.569
