father for what? 200?


01:08:02.594 --> 01:08:04.779
Daddy issues, I'm sure.


01:08:05.365 --> 01:08:07.948
Probably just wanted to
see him taken down a peg.


01:08:13.678 --> 01:08:14.950
You know...


01:08:17.115 --> 01:08:20.599
that conscience of yours
is gonna get you nowhere.


01:08:24.880 --> 01:08:27.421
You like spiders?


01:08:27.708 --> 01:08:30.004
No, actually.


01:08:30.029 --> 01:08:33.276
