kind of thing.


01:08:33.966 --> 01:08:36.079
My daughter actually makes
me wear long sleeves.


01:08:36.104 --> 01:08:37.771
- I'll probably change it.
- Yeah.


01:08:38.247 --> 01:08:39.771
