- Nah, beautiful creatures.


01:08:52.943 --> 01:08:55.355
So many different species,


01:08:55.380 --> 01:08:57.776
each with their own
unique characteristics.


01:08:59.635 --> 01:09:00.923
A bird in nature,


01:09:00.948 --> 01:09:04.406
now, that is the ultimate
symbol of freedom.


01:09:06.098 --> 01:09:08.515
Well, let me ask you something.


01:09:08.540 --> 01:09:10.915
One suddenly flies
into your home


01:09:10.940 --> 01:09:12.878
and starts squawking at you
from the kitchen counter.


01:09:12.903 --> 01:09:14.278
What do you do?


01:09:17.233 --> 01:09:19.924
You lose your fucking
mind. That's what!


01:09:19.949 --> 01:09:21.425
You leave the room,
you lock the door,


01:09:21.450 --> 01:09:23.876
