01:09:24.398 --> 01:09:26.982
They become unpredictable


01:09:27.007 --> 01:09:30.049
because it's not their habitat.


01:09:31.057 --> 01:09:33.307
It's not where they belong.


01:09:35.565 --> 01:09:37.232
So let me ask you...


01:09:38.625 --> 01:09:41.209
is this where you belong


01:09:41.234 --> 01:09:43.494
or are you unpredictable?


01:09:53.054 --> 01:09:55.388
No, I... I belong.


01:09:55.440 --> 01:09:58.118
I mean, I think this is...


01:09:58.143 --> 01:10:01.816
I'm just fucking with you. I
do with all the new recruits.


01:10:01.841 --> 01:10:04.924
Alright, let's get
down to it. 75 each.


01:10:07.327 --> 01:10:11.161
And 50 for the recruit.


01:10:16.974 --> 01:10:18.390
