01:10:23.268 --> 01:10:24.893
Hey, new guy.


01:10:27.772 --> 01:10:29.481
Aren't you gonna count it?


01:10:32.315 --> 01:10:34.565
- I'm good. I trust you guys.
- Oh, come on.


01:10:34.590 --> 01:10:36.798
It's our first time
working together.


01:10:36.823 --> 01:10:39.531
Let me give you
a word of advice.


01:10:39.556 --> 01:10:41.833
Never be too polite
to count your take.


01:10:44.226 --> 01:10:47.661
- I mean, it's... it's no problem.
- There should be 50 in there.


01:10:48.205 --> 01:10:51.080
Go ahead. Count. You earned it.


01:10:54.003 --> 01:10:55.466
If that's OK with you?


01:10:55.736 --> 01:10:57.435
