01:11:14.333 --> 01:11:15.833
There's only 25 in here.


01:11:16.187 --> 01:11:19.437
25? Not 50?


01:11:20.769 --> 01:11:23.630
Yeah, I mean, I
counted it twice.


01:11:24.197 --> 01:11:27.654
Oh, that's right. I gave
you an advance on that 25.


01:11:29.272 --> 01:11:31.189
You know, that money,


01:11:31.319 --> 01:11:33.527
probably been spending
all around town.


01:11:33.552 --> 01:11:34.927
It could be traceable.


01:11:35.132 --> 01:11:36.882
You see, we have a process here


01:11:36.907 --> 01:11:39.166
and you fucked up that process.


01:11:39.883 --> 01:11:42.603
What are you talking about?
What is she talking about?


01:11:43.194 --> 01:11:46.338
What you looking at him for?
He's not gonna help you.


01:11:48.949 --> 01:11:50.891
I didn't steal
any fucking money.


01:11:50.916 --> 01:11:52.390
I'm not that stupid, OK?


01:11:52.415 --> 01:11:54.790
I would never do that
to you guys, alright?


01:11:54.815 --> 01:11:57.690
I wouldn't, OK?
Jesus fucking Christ.


01:11:57.715 --> 01:12:00.298
I mean, fuck, I would
never fucking steal...


01:12:00.323 --> 01:12:02.323
Hey, get off him!


01:12:02.348 --> 01:12:03.431
Get off him!


01:12:05.718 --> 01:12:07.176
Get the fuck off him.


01:12:07.217 --> 01:12:09.050
You don't know what
was in Frank's safe!


01:12:09.075 --> 01:12:12.117
You weren't there.
You don't know.


01:12:12.462 --> 01:12:13.525
