01:12:19.152 --> 01:12:22.110
Let him up! He said
he didn't do it!


01:12:33.045 --> 01:12:34.439
He can't breathe.


01:12:35.856 --> 01:12:37.315
He can't breathe.
Give him his pipe.


01:12:37.340 --> 01:12:38.408
This?


01:12:42.585 --> 01:12:44.252
He can't breathe!


01:12:46.604 --> 01:12:48.197
Let him up!


01:12:49.083 --> 01:12:50.346
