01:12:52.457 --> 01:12:53.707
Get off him!


01:12:54.456 --> 01:12:55.748
I can't die, man.


01:12:55.773 --> 01:12:57.648
Let him up! Oh!


01:12:57.673 --> 01:13:00.382
Take the money from my cut!


01:13:00.407 --> 01:13:02.491
Fuck, get off of him!


01:13:02.516 --> 01:13:03.891
Get off him!


01:13:03.916 --> 01:13:05.458
