01:13:05.483 --> 01:13:09.275
Just listen to him.
Just let him talk.


01:13:12.897 --> 01:13:14.517
Leon.


01:13:15.428 --> 01:13:17.189
Leon, stay the fuck out of it.


01:13:17.453 --> 01:13:19.453
He fucked
you over too.


01:13:20.751 --> 01:13:22.126
You do the honours.


01:13:23.494 --> 01:13:26.827
Leon, stay the fuck
out of it. Leon!


01:13:28.400 --> 01:13:30.412
Oh! Oh, fuck!


01:13:30.959 --> 01:13:32.959
What the fuck, man?!


01:13:32.984 --> 01:13:35.234
"No-one gets hurt," I said.


01:13:35.506 --> 01:13:38.297
I'm putting out fires here
and you're starting new ones.


01:13:38.322 --> 01:13:40.408
Frank was holding money
for a lot of people.


01:13:40.433 --> 01:13:41.808
If anyone finds out about


01:13:41.833 --> 01:13:43.680
