01:14:00.195 --> 01:14:02.275
Help, please!


01:14:12.995 --> 01:14:14.471
You know, you're alright.


01:14:14.689 --> 01:14:17.708
You're a thieving piece of
shit, but I kinda like you.


01:14:17.733 --> 01:14:20.067
