01:14:33.891 --> 01:14:35.290
Oh, fuck.


01:14:36.031 --> 01:14:38.532
I can't leave her.
I can't leave her!


01:14:38.557 --> 01:14:40.000
Then you're fuckin' dead to me.


01:14:41.656 --> 01:14:43.602
Fuck! Oh!


01:15:03.743 --> 01:15:08.857
Now, you wanna die tonight
or you wanna get paid?


01:15:09.600 --> 01:15:11.641
You vindictive bitch.


01:15:14.804 --> 01:15:16.891
Alright, back off him.


01:15:23.169 --> 01:15:26.127
Keep that phone on
