01:21:57.694 --> 01:21:59.610
Oh, fuck!


01:21:59.635 --> 01:22:02.343
Fuck.


01:22:21.820 --> 01:22:25.695
Oh, fuck!


01:23:54.943 --> 01:23:56.235
OK.


01:24:06.434 --> 01:24:07.809
