to let her go!


01:26:13.027 --> 01:26:14.402
Yeah.


01:26:15.566 --> 01:26:17.941
I never understood you.


01:26:18.426 --> 01:26:21.693
<i>But now I see
exactly who you are.</i>


01:26:22.052 --> 01:26:24.706
<i>You are fucking cold.</i>


01:26:24.731 --> 01:26:28.474
