speech about hunting you down.


01:26:38.262 --> 01:26:41.004
<i>You know how this ends.</i>


01:26:41.029 --> 01:26:42.987
Yeah, I know how it works.


01:26:43.012 --> 01:26:45.220
I know your every movement.


01:26:45.245 --> 01:26:47.828
I know everybody
you've fucked over.


01:26:47.853 --> 01:26:49.978
This whole town's
gonna know soon.


01:26:50.846 --> 01:26:53.346
You're living on
borrowed time, lady,


01:26:53.446 --> 01:26:55.362
so you better find me.


01:26:55.387 --> 01:26:58.345
You won't make it
through the night.


01:26:58.646 --> 01:27:01.354
You got nowhere to go.


01:27:01.379 --> 01:27:03.379
You better kill me quick.


01:27:35.366 --> 01:27:36.825
Fuck!


01:27:37.903 --> 01:27:39.944
Fuck!


01:28:21.684 --> 01:28:23.725
<i>This is Officer Morales.</i>


01:28:24.560 --> 01:28:26.802
<i>- Hello?</i>
- The kid is dead.


01:28:27.747 --> 01:28:29.208
<i>What?</i>


01:28:29.976 --> 01:28:31.893
The old auto shop in Wyevale.


01:28:31.918 --> 01:28:36.044
<i>OK, slow down. Who's
dead? What's going on?</i>


01:28:37.216 --> 01:28:41.342
The kid, Jake. He's dead.


01:28:41.367 --> 01:28:43.636
<i>We're gonna dispatch a
unit to that location.</i>


01:28:43.661 --> 01:28:45.327
<i>Who is this?</i>


01:30:29.627 --> 01:30:32.877
Daddy, are you home?


01:31:14.136 --> 01:31:17.146
<i>♪ I took the high road ♪</i>


01:31:17.171 --> 01:31:19.841
<i>♪ The one less travelled ♪</i>


01:31:19.866 --> 01:31:22.071
<i>♪ A new beginning ♪</i>


01:31:22.096 --> 01:31:25.429
<i>♪ We're on our way ♪</i>


01:31:25.454 --> 01:31:28.349
<i>♪ Things were so doubtful ♪</i>


01:31:28.374 --> 01:31:31.583
<i>♪ But now we're made of gold ♪</i>


01:31:31.608 --> 01:31:35.966
<i>♪ Don't hate the
