<i>♪ Ooh-ooh-ooh, ooh-ooh-ooh ♪</i>


01:32:04.255 --> 01:32:07.074
<i>♪ We sailed the seven seas ♪</i>


01:32:07.099 --> 01:32:10.410
<i>♪ Fought a million waves ♪</i>


